## Why This Is Asked
The question probes multi-tenant isolation, dynamic QoS, and production-readiness concerns in a streaming compute fabric, including migration safety and SLA adherence.

## Key Concepts
- Tenancy isolation: schema-per-tenant vs shared tables; topic-per-tenant.
- SLA-driven scheduling and backpressure: priority queues, token-bucket pacing, preemption.
- Canary migrations: tenant-level flags, telemetry, rollback.
- Idempotency: request_id deduping, exactly-once semantics.
- Observability: per-tenant dashboards and alerts.

## Code Example
